name: ['All-Seeing Arbiter', 'Braids, Arisen Nightmare', 'Power Word Kill', 'Recruitment Officer', 'Shivan Devastator', 'Skyclave Apparition', 'Surge Engine', 'Touch the Spirit Realm', 'Workshop Warchief']
